{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41646","headline":"鸡鸣曲 · 陈陶","name":"鸡鸣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡声春晓上林中，一声惊落虾蟆宫。\n二声唤破枕边梦，三声行人烟海红。\n平旦慵将百雏语，蓬松锦绣当阳处。\n媿君饮食长相呼，爲君昼鸣下高树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}